<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CNB-120 INDEX RISES 3.3 POINTS TO 784.1 PTS.</title>
<headline>CZECH CNB-120 INDEX RISES 3.3 POINTS TO 784.1 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 3.3 points, or 0.42 percent, on Wednesday to 784.1, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eigth of the ten sectoral indices gained, with the transport index rising the most, up 21.2 points, or 1.81 percent, to 1,189.6 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
